## Third-party Components

This project incorporates code and dependencies from the following sources:

### Windows DDC/CI Implementation
- Based on public domain example code from CSDN article:
  https://blog.csdn.net/sinat_26143945/article/details/135137436
- No explicit license, used as educational reference

### macOS ddcctl
- Project: https://github.com/kfix/ddcctl
- License: GPL v3
- Note: When using ddcctl, the GPL v3 license applies to that component

### nlohmann/json (optional)
- Project: https://github.com/nlohmann/json
- License: MIT License
- Copyright (c) 2013-2022 Niels Lohmann

